    "summary": "[Inflamed Reprisal](vsdata:ability/death-guard.mortarion.inflamed-reprisal) on Mortarion is rewritten. In your opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if an enemy attack targets a **DEATH GUARD** unit of yours no more than 6\" from Mortarion, Mortarion may use this ability to let that **DEATH GUARD** unit shoot after the attacker's attacks are all resolved, using the rules for your own Shooting phase, but:\n\n- its attacks have their **BS** worsened by 1\n- it can only target the attacking unit, and only if that unit is an eligible target",
